update gpt_apps a set starter_prompts=v.p, updated_at=now() from (values ('aqualis-oceanic-health-monitor-pollution-forecaster',ARRAY['I want to analyze my coastal water samples for pollution trends and potential risks to marine biodiversity.','I want a visual map of projected coastal pollution spread using my sampling locations and current data.']),('automobile-gpt',ARRAY['My car shakes when braking at highway speeds; I want likely causes and a prioritized inspection checklist.','I want a labeled image explaining how my car''s disc brakes work and where common wear occurs.']),('binary-text-converter-gpt',ARRAY['I want to convert ''Hello, world!'' into UTF-8 binary, with each byte separated and explained.','I want a visual showing how each letter in my name converts into eight-bit ASCII binary.']),('buildyourgpts',ARRAY['I want custom GPT instructions for a grant reviewer that scores proposals against my nonprofit''s rubric.','I want an avatar image for my custom astronomy tutor GPT, featuring a friendly telescope mascot.']),('business-plan-generator-gpt',ARRAY['I need a complete business plan for my mobile coffee cart, starting with the executive summary.','I want a visual business model diagram for my subscription bakery, showing customers, costs, and revenue streams.']),('cannabis-gpt-not-gpt4o1-compliant',ARRAY['I want to compare Blue Dream and Sour Diesel genetics, distinguishing documented lineage from disputed claims.','I want a visual family tree of Kush strain genetics, clearly marking uncertain parentage.']),('ccsba-receipt-generator-gpt-for-donors',ARRAY['I need a donor receipt drafted from my donation details, preserving the organization''s exact required wording.','I want an image mockup of my donor receipt layout, with placeholder fields and a sample watermark.']),('celebrity-chatline-gpt',ARRAY['I want to roleplay a detective interview with Sherlock Holmes, complete with deductions and dry wit.','I''d like an image of my fictional tea party with Sherlock Holmes and Dracula.']),('children-s-picture-book-generator',ARRAY['I want a twelve-page picture book about a shy octopus making friends, for ages three to five.','I''d like an image for my book''s opening spread, showing a shy octopus outside a coral classroom.']),('college-degree-gpt',ARRAY['I want a semester-long introductory psychology course with weekly readings, assignments, quizzes, and a final project.','I''d like a visual curriculum map for my four-year computer science degree, showing prerequisites and electives.']),('diagraph-chart-gpt',ARRAY['I want my uploaded sales spreadsheet turned into quarterly comparison charts, highlighting regional trends and outliers.','I''d like a visual dashboard of my monthly expenses, with category breakdowns and spending trends.']),('firefighter-gpt',ARRAY['I need a wildfire training scenario for incident commanders, including wind shifts, evacuation triggers, and resource allocation.','I''d like a visual briefing map for my fictional wildfire exercise, marking safety zones and escape routes.']),('fisherman-gpt',ARRAY['I''m targeting largemouth bass in a muddy reservoir this spring; recommend lures, retrieve speeds, and likely locations.','I''d like an image showing my beginner trout rig, with labeled hook, split shot, float, and knots.']),('free-college-lessons-or-any-subject-education-open-source-prompt-to-be-shared-wi',ARRAY['I want free college-level calculus lessons using open educational resources, with worked examples and weekly practice problems.','I''d like a visual explaining supply and demand shifts for my first college economics lesson.']),('front-end-gpt',ARRAY['I want a responsive React portfolio with project filters, accessible navigation, and step-by-step deployment instructions.','I''d like an image mockup of my bakery website, with mobile layouts and an online ordering section.']),('greenleaf-logistics-gpt',ARRAY['I need a compliance checklist for transporting licensed cannabis inventory between California facilities, including manifests and tracking.','I''d like a visual workflow for my licensed cannabis distribution operation, from inventory intake through documented delivery.']),('hemp-gpt-4o1-complaint',ARRAY['I want to understand hemp certificate-of-analysis results, including cannabinoid potency, pesticide screening, and heavy metal limits.','I''d like a visual guide to reading my hemp product''s lab report, highlighting potency and contaminant sections.']),('home-renovator-gpt',ARRAY['I''m remodeling a small bathroom on a $10,000 budget; prioritize upgrades and outline the contractor work sequence.','I''d like an image of my remodeled galley kitchen, featuring oak cabinets, quartz counters, and improved lighting.']),('learn-any-skill-gpt',ARRAY['I want to learn acoustic guitar from scratch through daily twenty-minute lessons, practice drills, and progress checks.','I''d like a visual practice roadmap for my beginner watercolor lessons, from brush control to landscape painting.']),('legal-draftsmith-gpt',ARRAY['I need a freelance design agreement under California law covering payment milestones, revisions, ownership, and termination.','I''d like a visual flowchart of my lease''s termination provisions, showing notice deadlines and required actions.']),('logo-generator',ARRAY['I need three logo concepts for my coastal coffee shop, using wave motifs and restrained typography.','I''d like an image of my mountain bakery logo, combining a wheat stalk with an alpine silhouette.']),('long-book-writer-gpt-with-compile-page-by-page',ARRAY['I want to write a historical mystery page by page, maintaining a continuity ledger and compiling approved chapters.','I''d like an image of my fantasy novel''s cover, featuring a ruined observatory beneath two moons.']),('luminex-climate-crisis-analyst',ARRAY['I want a Python analysis of warming trends in my uploaded regional temperature dataset.','Create an image for my presentation comparing coastal flood risks under two emissions scenarios.']),('mary-magdalene-gpt',ARRAY['I want to explore inner spiritual authority through Mary Magdalene’s teachings in the Gospel of Mary.','Create an image for my meditation depicting Mary Magdalene teaching, inspired by Gnostic themes.']),('training-manual-generator-gpt',ARRAY['I need a warehouse onboarding manual covering forklift safety, inventory scanning, and supervisor signoffs.','Create a visual flowchart for my training manual showing customer complaint escalation steps.']),('veterinarian-gpt',ARRAY['My cat is drinking more water and losing weight; which symptoms require urgent veterinary care?','Create an image for my pet care guide illustrating common signs of canine dehydration.']),('video-second-by-second-analysis-gpt',ARRAY['Ask me to upload my video, then analyze its first five seconds with timestamped observations.','Create a visual storyboard of my uploaded clip’s first five seconds, labeling each second separately.']),('virtual-stylist-gpt',ARRAY['I need three outfits for a summer garden wedding using my existing navy linen suit.','Create a virtual try-on image of me wearing a tailored emerald suit using my uploaded photo.']),('world-reality-decoder-gpt-u',ARRAY['I want this geopolitical claim dissected into verified facts, assumptions, incentives, and missing evidence.','Create a visual map for my analysis showing stakeholders, incentives, and evidence behind this geopolitical dispute.']),('movie-script-writer-gpt',ARRAY['I want to develop my locked-room thriller premise into a three-act screenplay outline with character arcs.','Create a storyboard image for my screenplay’s opening scene: a detective entering an abandoned observatory.']),('news-channel-gpt',ARRAY['I need a broadcast-style investigation of today’s major energy policy announcement, with sources and unanswered questions.','Create a newsroom explainer image for my report comparing verified facts with disputed claims.']),('nikola-tesla-gpt',ARRAY['I want to understand how a rotating magnetic field drives an alternating-current induction motor.','Create an annotated image for my physics lesson showing Tesla’s rotating magnetic field principle.']),('os-book-writer',ARRAY['I want to turn my family’s migration history into a memoir outline with chapter summaries.','Create a book cover image for my historical novel set aboard a nineteenth-century immigrant ship.']),('playwriter-gpt',ARRAY['I need a two-act stage play about estranged siblings, with three actors and one set.','Create a stage design image for my intimate family drama set in a cramped kitchen.']),('predictive-credit-score-checker-gpt',ARRAY['I want to understand potential credit score changes using my payment history and utilization, not my address.','Create a visual guide for me explaining how utilization and payment history can affect credit scores.']),('probability-gpt',ARRAY['I need a yes-or-no assessment of this statistical claim, supported by calculations and explicit assumptions.','Create a probability tree image for my problem involving two draws without replacement.']),('product-photography-designer-gpt',ARRAY['I need a premium skincare advertising concept using my bottle photo, with lighting and prop directions.','Create a hyperrealistic advertisement image using my uploaded perfume bottle, with amber lighting and wet stone.']),('property-data-finder-newer',ARRAY['I need a web search for this property''s ownership, tax assessments, zoning, and recent sales, with sources.','Create a visual comparison of my shortlisted properties using verified sale prices, lot sizes, and taxes.']),('public-defender-gpt',ARRAY['I need a suppression motion outline addressing the warrantless vehicle search described in my client''s police report.','Create a visual timeline of my client''s arrest, arraignment, and discovery deadlines under our jurisdiction''s rules.']),('quiz-maker-ai',ARRAY['I want a ten-question photosynthesis quiz for seventh graders, with answer explanations and mixed difficulty.','Create an image-based geometry quiz for my class, featuring labeled triangles and an answer key.']),('short-book-writer-gpt-with-compile',ARRAY['I want to write and compile a complete beginner''s gardening book with eight practical, cohesive chapters.','Create a cover image for my beginner''s gardening book featuring balcony planters and warm botanical colors.']),('skincare-gpt',ARRAY['I need a gentle morning and evening routine for sensitive, acne-prone skin using my current products.','Create a visual layering guide for my cleanser, moisturizer, sunscreen, and retinol, separating morning and nighttime use.']),('solar-land-assessor-gpt',ARRAY['I need a solar suitability assessment of this parcel covering slope, flood risk, access, and grid proximity.','Create a conceptual visual layout for my solar parcel showing arrays, setbacks, access roads, and drainage exclusions.']),('stellaris-space-explorer',ARRAY['I want a settlement feasibility assessment for this exoplanet using atmospheric composition, gravity, radiation, and water availability.','Create a visual plan for my exoplanet colony showing habitats, radiation shelters, greenhouses, and power infrastructure.']),('sustainable-futures-gpt',ARRAY['I need a sourced comparison of my city''s water demand, drought exposure, and conservation options through 2040.','Create a visual dashboard of my region''s emissions, renewable energy share, and water stress using sourced data.']),('tattoo-design-gpt',ARRAY['I want a fine-line forearm tattoo combining native wildflowers and a crescent moon, sized six inches.','Create an image of my mountain-and-river tattoo with a matching black stencil outline for my calf.']),('testimony-writer-gpt',ARRAY['I need a two-minute city council testimony opposing library cuts, grounded in my family''s actual experiences.','Create a visual handout supporting my school board testimony with clear charts from these budget figures.']),('social-safety-net-gpt',ARRAY['I need to identify food, rent, and healthcare assistance; ask about my location, household, and income first.','Create a visual application checklist for my eligible assistance programs, including required documents and verified deadlines.'])) as v(slug,p) where a.slug=v.slug;